cerune_lvl3 (popup)\n\n- feed value: 12\n- max_level: true\n- description: Feed to the Devourer.\n  [source: popup]\n## Item icerunes (popup)\n\n- feed value: 5\n- description: Merge to create a bigger pile or feed to the Devourer.\n  [source: popup]\n## Item lockedchest (popup)\n\n- description: Tap to watch an advert to unlock this Valuable Chest.\n  [source: popup]\n## Item manapool_lvl1 (popup)\n\n- feed value: 60\n- damage value: 25\n- description: Increases Mana Cap. Merge to lvl up.\n- edge: Mana Cap +2000\n  [source: popup]\n## Item manapot_lvl3 (popup)\n\n- feed value: 22\n- max_level: true\n- description: Feed to the Devourer.\n  [source: popup]\n## Item manapotion_lvl1 (popup)\n\n- description: Increases Mana Cap. Merge to lvl up.\n- edge: Mana Cap +2000\n  [source: popup]\n## Item manapotion_lvl3 (popup)\n\n- feed value: 22\n- max_level: true\n- description: Feed to the Devourer.\n  [source: popup]"}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "[image]"}}, {"type": "text", "text": "This is the current board. The board state is already provided below (see Tool results) \u2014 decide the single best move and reply with ONLY a valid JSON action (merge, spawn, feed, attack, collect, or idle). There are no tools in this round \u2014 never emit a tool call or a tool name as the action."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": null, "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_board_state", "arguments": "{}"}, "id": "wzKMY0pAT9qlA0zQ77i5dlbv8d45xQcB"}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "wzKMY0pAT9qlA0zQ77i5dlbv8d45xQcB", "content": "Occupied cells (template bank labels):\n- (0,0) coins_lvl2 (feed 5) [FEEDABLE] (score 0.96, margin 0.63)\n- (0,1) coins_lvl1 (feed 2) [FEEDABLE] (score 0.93, margin 0.60)\n- (0,2) manapool_lvl1 (feed 60) (dmg 25) (score 0.91, margin 0.53)\n- (0,3) necromerger [UNKNOWN VALUE \u2014 do not feed] (score 0.97, margin 0.71)\n- (1,1) gems_lvl1 (feed 2) [FEEDABLE] (score 0.98, margin 0.56)\n- (1,